  intron_cov_frac              7.96x  simulation OVER-injects  (layer 2: --premrna-frac-low/high 0.01/0.10)
  se_minor_count               7.15x  simulation OVER-injects  (_sample_psi_pair)
  cov_mean                     5.69x  simulation OVER-injects  (--gene-mean-depth 2000)
